# Google sign-in. Use the Web client ID. Do not put the client secret in this file.
EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-web-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
# Optional. Needed for a phone build. These clients have no secret.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_IOS_CLIENT_ID=
# EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_ANDROID_CLIENT_ID=

# Optional. The app already has these values in src/lib/supabase.ts and src/lib/api.ts.
# Set one here only when you need to point this install at a different server.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT_REF.supabase.co
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.10:4000
#
# The live API address and listing prices come from Firebase Remote Config
# on the vadi-hisab project, the same way as VADI Hisab. Keys:
#   property_api_base_url, custom_property_price, premium_property_price
